      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TIGER ROCKS (1) finds it hard to break through. Has finished in the placings two on end now, the latest when third (30.67) at this track. Solid record at the distance winning two races. Has performed well from this box with a win and 11 minor placings to his name from 17 starts. Can find winning form. ATHENS AURA (2) rocketed out of the boxes with a strong early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when third (25.75) at Shepparton over 450m. Will give a great sight again. WINDORAH (5) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 7th at Shepparton following on from a third place finish (25.80) there the start prior. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. HEATHCOTE RUPEE (3) will need to run right up to last start to feature again.",
